# Auth step definitions — Acme demo project vocabulary.
#
# `Composite:` = a pure group of step references (expanded at plan time).
# The body must contain only Gherkin steps. Leaves (`step:`) carry run ops
# or code blocks. See skills/gherkin-web-qa/SKILL.md.

Composite: the user "{name}" is logged in
  When I open the page "index.html"
  And I fill the "Username" field with "{name}"
  And I fill the "Password" field with "secret"
  And I click "Sign In"
  Then I should be on the dashboard
